y has come in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, and it is also the wettest pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 182% of normal in April to May and 53% in November to December. In 2026 the middle of the grids came in at 46% of normal in January to February. Every grid had its driest year in 1963, with grid 20876 at 58%.</p>"}
